{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Sky Fields: Goober Gardens Demo</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the demo of Sky Fields: Goober Gardens. You will have access to your own island where you can grow a garden of Goobers. The grassy and peaceful island will give you a good springboard to start up your own Pet-Sim experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/extras/Goober.gif?t=1759346194\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes the ability to raise your goobers similarly to the full game. Your goobers will need feeding to grow in size, strength and in their own unique way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a portion of the goobers available in the full game. Red's have high attack damage, blues higher ability power. Utilise their strengths to form a strong squad. Your map is friend in keeping track of those you have unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/extras/image.png?t=1759346194\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade collectibles with the travelling merchant to build your team stronger. Get a taste of a selection of equippable items that can aid your progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your hardy Goobers to defend your Garden from hostile travellers and to protect the softer, squishier goobers of your bunch!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797170?t=1759346194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/2e94d1c23f648c78de64437a7dbd33033d75f661/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759346194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/9236754c353b79908a4d7bc1aec8464e24f5da99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759346194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/9236754c353b79908a4d7bc1aec8464e24f5da99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759346194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Sky Fields: Goober Gardens Demo</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the demo of Sky Fields: Goober Gardens. You will have access to your own island where you can grow a garden of Goobers. The grassy and peaceful island will give you a good springboard to start up your own Pet-Sim experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/extras/Goober.gif?t=1759346194\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes the ability to raise your goobers similarly to the full game. Your goobers will need feeding to grow in size, strength and in their own unique way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a portion of the goobers available in the full game. Red's have high attack damage, blues higher ability power. Utilise their strengths to form a strong squad. Your map is friend in keeping track of those you have unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/extras/image.png?t=1759346194\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade collectibles with the travelling merchant to build your team stronger. Get a taste of a selection of equippable items that can aid your progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your hardy Goobers to defend your Garden from hostile travellers and to protect the softer, squishier goobers of your bunch!</p>","developers":["Lontis, The Developer"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3675950","name":"Sky Fields: Goober Gardens"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797170/ea98225f9b95600cfb849d11e084661aae0df193/header.jpg?t=1759346194","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797170/1560346418/30cf36649043a72ccb0fb1928b3d33f8e4be66b3/1750370382/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759261015","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797170/1560346418/30cf36649043a72ccb0fb1928b3d33f8e4be66b3/1750370382/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759261015","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797170/1560346418/30cf36649043a72ccb0fb1928b3d33f8e4be66b3/1750370382/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759261015","id":257152391,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152391/movie480.mp4?t=1759261015","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152391/movie_max.mp4?t=1759261015"},"name":"Sky Fields: Goober Gardens Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shar